// VertexLitGeneric with $phong (skin_ps20b / skin_vs20) in the combos the
// native skin family cannot draw, which take the port: cube env maps (tint,
// Fresnel, base or normal alpha masks, the inverted phong mask, the fast
// path), detail textures and every blend mode, wrinkle maps (base and normal),
// and the light warp, under the ambient cube and up to four point, spot and
// directional lights, with the phong warp, exponent map, rim light and fog.
// forced/skin_native_combos.vdf holds the combos the native family keeps.
// The vertex record carries no flex stream, so the wrinkle weight is zero and
// the wrinkle cases prove only that the textures blend in at weight zero.
// Quads are in clip space (identity transforms), so the eye is at the origin.
